* ==============================================================================
* sfs-stepper-power-spice: power stage models (ngspice)
*
* File:        circuits/esc1_leg.lib
* Description: One half-bridge leg of the B-G431B-ESC1: L6387 driver, two
*              STL180N6F7, gate resistors, bootstrap capacitor, low-side shunt.
*              Values not published in the user manual (schematic MB1419) are
*              parameters with assumed defaults - replace them with the schematic.
*
* Author:      Anton Vynohradov
* Email:       avynohradov@systemfromscratch.com
* License:     Apache License 2.0
* Copyright:   (c) 2026 Anton Vynohradov
*
* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
* ==============================================================================

* pins: bus gnd out hin lin vcc shunt (shunt = top of the shunt resistor)
* parameters:
*   rg     gate resistor (assumption 10 Ohm)        cboot  bootstrap capacitor (assumption 1 uF)
*   rsh    shunt (assumption 3 mOhm)                lsh    shunt + layout inductance (assumption 1 nH)
*   lloop  commutation loop inductance (assumption 3 nH), split between the two switches
*   rdamp  resistor across each layout inductance: losses of the loop (skin effect, bus
*          capacitor ESR) that damp the ringing within a few ns (assumption 1 Ohm)
*   tj     junction temperature (degC)
.subckt ESC1_LEG bus gnd out hin lin vcc shunt params: rg=10 cboot=1u rsh=3m lsh=1n
+ lloop=3n rdamp=1 tj=25
XDRV hin lin vcc gnd boot hvg out lvg L6387_BEHAV
CBOOT boot out {cboot}
RGH hvg gh {rg}
RGL lvg gl {rg}
LH bus dh {lloop / 2}
RLH bus dh {rdamp}
MQH dh gh out STL180N6F7_SFS temp={tj}
MQL out gl sl STL180N6F7_SFS temp={tj}
LL sl shunt {lloop / 2}
RLL sl shunt {rdamp}
RSH shunt sh2 {rsh}
LSH sh2 gnd {lsh}
RLSH sh2 gnd {rdamp}
.ends ESC1_LEG
